     "titulo": "Structure of a transport notice",
     "texto": [
      "On a departures board the type of train and destination come first (**ICE nach Hamburg**), then the time (**Abfahrt 09:15**), the platform (**Gleis 3**) and any problems (**Verspätung** / delay; **fällt aus** / cancelled)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
